# Double-rail / snake score: cue checks with strong opposite side and returns to the first cushion as the third cue rail.
# Goal: high-speed bottom/top/bottom rail pattern; only two physical cushions produce the three-cushion count before red.
table three_cushion_carom_10ft
game three_cushion
ball cue at (2.721, 6.737)
ball yellow at (3.407, 4.526)
ball red at (1.072929622, 1.810729986)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.08)
simulation(default)
  .preset(three_cushion)
  .max_events(36)
trace(max_events: 36)
shot(cue).heading(166.187883679deg).speed(219.897581189ips).tip(side: -0.074494772R, height: 0.096268040R).using(default)
